--cpp11 --unwind 6 --no-unwinding-assertions
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
Exercises std::list, whose node creation constructs a
std::__allocated_ptr RAII guard via a braced-init-list.  Such a class (with
user-provided constructors) is not an aggregate, so the braced-init must call a
constructor rather than perform member-wise aggregate initialization.
